      "content": "i know, i know, you're not a doctor but i'm just looking for some info. i've heard from people who swear by the oregano oil method and say that as long as you take enough of it, it clears the infection right up. i'm just really scared of the side effects from antibiotics and the cost of a doctor visit right now. if i just go really heavy on the supplements for a few days, it's basically the same thing as a prescription, right? it's just natural, so it can't be that bad.",
